@startuml ביצוע הזמנה - Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #f8f9fa

title Sequence: ביצוע הזמנה (Place Order)

actor "משתמש\n(User)" as User
participant "Frontend\n(React App)" as Frontend
participant "Order Controller\n(Backend)" as OrderController
participant "Order Service\n(Business Logic)" as OrderService
participant "Cart Service\n(Cart Logic)" as CartService
participant "Product Service\n(Product Logic)" as ProductService
participant "Database\n(MongoDB)" as Database

User -> Frontend: 1. לחיצה על "ביצוע הזמנה"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> OrderController: 2. POST /api/orders/create
activate OrderController

OrderController -> CartService: 3. getUserCart(userId)
activate CartService

CartService -> Database: 4. find({userId}).populate('productId')
activate Database

Database --> CartService: 5. פריטי עגלה + פרטי מוצרים
deactivate Database

CartService --> OrderController: 6. עגלה מלאה
deactivate CartService

OrderController -> ProductService: 7. validateCartStock(cartItems)
activate ProductService

ProductService -> Database: 8. בדיקת מלאי לכל פריט
activate Database

Database --> ProductService: 9. סטטוס זמינות
deactivate Database

ProductService --> OrderController: 10. אימות מלאי
deactivate ProductService

alt מלאי זמין
    OrderController -> OrderService: 11. createOrder(cartItems, userInfo)
    activate OrderService
    
    OrderService -> Database: 12. insertOne(orderData)
    activate Database
    
    Database --> OrderService: 13. הזמנה נוצרה
    deactivate Database
    
    OrderService -> Database: 14. insertMany(orderItems)
    activate Database
    
    Database --> OrderService: 15. פריטי הזמנה נוצרו
    deactivate Database
    
    OrderService -> ProductService: 16. updateStock(orderItems)
    activate ProductService
    
    ProductService -> Database: 17. updateMany(products, {$inc: {stock: -quantity}})
    activate Database
    
    Database --> ProductService: 18. מלאי עודכן
    deactivate Database
    
    ProductService --> OrderService: 19. עדכון מלאי הושלם
    deactivate ProductService
    
    OrderService -> CartService: 20. clearUserCart(userId)
    activate CartService
    
    CartService -> Database: 21. deleteMany({userId})
    activate Database
    
    Database --> CartService: 22. עגלה נוקתה
    deactivate Database
    
    CartService --> OrderService: 23. עגלה נוקתה
    deactivate CartService
    
    OrderService --> OrderController: 24. {orderId, orderNumber, success: true}
    deactivate OrderService
    
    OrderController --> Frontend: 25. 201 Created + order details
    deactivate OrderController
    
    Frontend --> User: 26. הפניה לעמוד תשלום
    deactivate Frontend

else מלאי לא זמין
    OrderController --> Frontend: 27. 400 Bad Request - מלאי לא מספיק
    deactivate OrderController
    
    Frontend --> User: 28. הודעת שגיאה + עדכון עגלה
    deactivate Frontend
end

@enduml
